    "updated_at": "2021-05-13T14:53:10Z",
    "body": "> Starship should reset any styling at the end of the prompt. Can you pipe the output of `starship prompt` in a file and post it here to confirm starship is doing this?\r\n> Also as a workaround you could try setting the `terminal.integrated.minimumContrastRatio` option in VSCode to improve readability.\r\n\r\nThanks for the help. Here's the output of `starship prompt`:\r\n\r\n```\r\n\u001b[J\r\n\u001b[1;36m🏠/Downloads\u001b[0m \r\n➜ \r\n```",
