    "updated_at": "2021-06-16T12:42:20Z",
    "body": "For anybody coming across this issue, the problem was not Starship but my choice of font. There was a bug that was rendering the font (Source Code Pro) always black in the VSCode integrated terminal. I thought I was using the powerline one but I wasn't. So when I changed the font family for the integrated terminal to (Source Code Pro for Powerline) and reload the VSCode window it's all back to normal. ",
